{%- capture text_content -%}
	{%- if section.settings.subheading != blank -%}
		<h3 class="SectionHeader__SubHeading Heading Heading--caps Heading--textFont u-h6"><span>{{ section.settings.subheading }}</span></h3>
	{%- endif -%}

	{%- if section.settings.title != blank -%}
		<h2 class="SectionHeader__Heading Heading u-h3"><span>{{ section.settings.title }}</span></h2>
	{%- endif -%}

	{%- if section.settings.description != blank -%}
		<div class="SectionHeader__Description SectionHeader__Description--primary Rte">
			{{ section.settings.description }}
		</div>
	{%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

{{ 'section-accordion.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

<section class="Section Section--spacingExtraLarge" data-section-type="accordion" data-section-id="{{ section.id }}">
	<div class="Container">
		<div class="Grid">
			<div class="Grid__Cell 3/16--lap-and-up"></div>
			<div class="Grid__Cell 10/16--lap-and-up">
				{{ text_content }}

	<div class="Accordion__Section Heading Heading--caps Heading--textFont u-h6">
		<span class="Anchor" id="block-static-1"></span>
		<p>Our Jewellery</p>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Where and how is your jewellery made?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>The majority of NMJ pieces are handcrafted to order by our skilled team of jewellers and stone setters.</p>
	                <p>Our Avalon studio sits at the heart of our production process, where each order is carefully reviewed, allocated and then brought to life by jewellers specialising in different areas of the craft. With the majority of our pieces handmade in Australia, we also work with a small network of trusted offshore production partners to produce select components, which are then set and personalised by hand by our in house team of jewellers. Find out more about our production processes here.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What materials and precious metals do you use?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>We work with enduring precious metals and carefully selected natural and laboratory-grown stones, chosen for their quality, beauty and suitability for each design.</p>
	                <p>Our precious metal offering includes sterling silver, 9ct, 14ct and 18ct gold in yellow, rose and white tones. We use a combination of newly mined and recycled metal, and prioritise using Australian mined gold where possible.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What is the difference between 9ct, 14ct and 18ct gold?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>The carat measure of gold refers to the proportion of fine gold contained within the metal.</p>
	                <p>9ct gold contains 37.5% fine gold</p>
	                <p>14ct gold contains 58.5% fine gold</p>
	                <p>18ct gold contains 75% fine gold.</p>
	                <p>Fine gold is naturally soft, so it is combined with other metals to create an alloy that is suitable for everyday jewellery. The balance of gold and alloying metals influences the piece’s colour, strength, durability and price. We follow industry standards across our offering, with engagement and wedding jewellery crafted largely in 18ct, and everyday fine jewellery crafted largely in 9ct.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What is the difference between yellow, rose and white gold?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Yellow, rose and white gold all begin with fine gold. Their individual tones are created by carefully combining the gold with different alloying metals.</p>
	                <p>Yellow gold retains the warm, traditional character most closely associated with gold. Rose gold has a soft blush tone create by a higher proportion of copper in the alloy. White gold combines gold with pale-tones metals and is finished with rhodium plating to create its bright white appearance. All alloys wear equally, depending on the carat measure.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Is your jewellery nickel-free?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Our jewellery is crafted in accordance with European standards governing nickel release, which set strict limits for jewellery intended to be worn against the skin.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Are your diamonds and gemstones responsibly sourced?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Responsible sourcing is an ongoing commitment at NMJ and an important consideration in every supplier relationship we establish.</p>
	                <p>Our suppliers are assessed through a detailed due diligence framework covering human rights, environmental responsibility, legality, traceability and responsible business practices. Suppliers are asked to provide supporting policies and evidence, and those unwilling to engage with our requirements are removed from our supply chain. Additionally, all of our diamond suppliers adhere to the Kimberly Process.</p>
	                <p>Where we make a specific claim about a gemstone’s origin, that claim is supported by written evidence of provenance. We also prioritise locally sourced stones where possible, including Australian sapphires from Central Queensland.</p>
	                <p>We recognise that jewellery supply chains are complex and that responsible sourcing is not a fixed destination. We remain committed to continually improving transparency, traceability and accountability throughout our supply network.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Are your diamonds certified?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Unless otherwise stated, all natural and laboratory-grown diamonds over 0.30ct are independently certified by a recognised gemmological laboratory. Each certified diamond is accompanied by a detailed certificate outlining its individual characteristics and quality.</p>
	                <p>All certified diamonds also feature a unique identification number laser-inscribed on the girdle, corresponding with the information provided on the certificate.</p>
	                <p>Smaller accent diamonds are not typically certified individually. Where certification applies, the certificate will be provided with your finished piece.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What is the difference between natural and laboratory-grown diamonds?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Natural diamonds are formed deep within the earth over billions of years, while laboratory-grown diamonds are created in a controlled environment using technology that replicates the conditions under which natural diamonds develop.</p>
	                <p>Both are genuine diamonds, sharing the same chemical composition, physical properties and beautiful brilliance. The key difference is simply their origin. Laboratory-grown diamonds generally offer a more accessible price point, while natural diamonds are valued for their rarity and unique geological history.</p>
	                <p>We offer both options, allowing you to choose the diamond that best reflects your preferences, values and budget. Unless otherwise stated, all natural and laboratory-grown diamonds over 0.30ct are independently certified and feature a corresponding identification number laser-inscribed on the girdle.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Why can natural stones and precious metal alloys vary between pieces?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Natural stones are formed through unique geological processes, meaning no two are ever exactly alike. Subtle variations in colour, tone, pattern, inclusion and other natural characteristics may occur from one stone to another. These details are part of each stone’s story and contribute to the individual beauty of every piece rather than being considered faults.</p>
	                <p>The colour of precious metal alloys may also vary slightly between pieces. This is because gold is blended with other metals to create is colour, strength and carat, and subtle differences between individual alloy batches can influence the finished tone. These natural variations are to be expected and make each piece uniquely yours.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Will my finished piece look exactly like the piece shown online?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>As many of our pieces are handcrafted to order and feature natural stones, your finished piece may vary slightly from the product imagery shown online. Subject differences in stone colour, tone, pattern and natural inclusions may occur, while the colour of precious metal alloys can also vary slightly between individual batches.</p>
	                <p>We take great care to remain true to the original design and overall aesthetic of each piece. These subtle variations are a beautiful reflection of the materials and handcrafted process, giving every piece its own individual character.</p>
	                <p>We endeavour to always provide detailed dimensions and scale information, including images of the pieces worn on the body for reference.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What is a One of a Kind piece?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Our One of a Kind pieces are truly unique designs, created as an extension of our bespoke offering. Each piece is thoughtfully designed to celebrate the individual characteristics of a particular stone.</p>
	                <p>Because of the unique nature of the stone or design, these pieces cannot be replicated exactly. Once a One of a Kind piece has found its forever home, there will never be another precisely the same.</p>
	                <p>If you miss out on a one of a kind piece, our bespoke team can work with you to create a design which is equally unique in design and form.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Accordion__Section Heading Heading--caps Heading--textFont u-h6">
		<span class="Anchor" id="block-static-2"></span>
		<p>Sizing and Personalisation</p>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How can I determine my ring size?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>We know that finding the right ring size can feel a little daunting, particularly when the piece is intended as a surprise.</p>
	                <p>For the most accurate result, we recommend visiting one of our retail locations for an in-person sizing consultation or contacting our Customer Service team to request a ring sizer. If you are purchasing a ring as a surprise, our Ring Size Guide also includes some helpful guidance.</p>
	                <p>If you are unable to visit our showrooms, you can purchase our self ring sizing tool here.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How can I choose the right necklace or chain length?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Each of our necklaces is offered in the length we feel best complements the design, with thoughtful consideration given to how it can be worn alone or layered with our other pieces.</p>
	                <p>If you prefer a different length, please contact our Customer Service team before placing your order. They will be happy to discuss the available options and advise whether an alternative or customised chain length is possible for your chosen piece.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Can I request a ring size or chain length that is not listed online?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Yes. If your preferred ring size or chain length is not available online, please contact our Customer Service Team. They will be happy to discuss your requirements and work with you to find the most suitable option for your chosen piece.</p>
	                <p>Please note that availability may depend on the design, materials and construction of the piece, and additional costs or production time may apply.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How does sizing work for men’s rings and signet rings?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Finding the correct size is especially important for men’s rings and wedding bands. Wherever possible, we recommend visiting one of our showrooms so our team can professionally size your finger and help you find the most comfortable fit.</p>
	                <p>If visiting us is not possible, we recommend being professionally sized by a jeweller. When being measured, please let them know the width and depth of your chosen ring – these measurements are available on each product page – as wider or heavier bands may require a slightly larger size for a comfortable fit.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Can I customise or personalise an existing NMJ design?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Where possible, we would be happy to help you make an existing NMJ design feel uniquely your own. Depending on the piece, customisation options may include changes to the metal, stones, sizing or personal details such as engraving.</p>
	                <p>Please contact our Customer Service team before placing your order. They can discuss what may be possible and provide a personalised quotation for your requested changes. As each design is carefully considered, some customisations may not be suitable or achievable.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Do you offer engraving?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Yes, we offer hand engraving on selected pieces. Hand engraving is a highly specialised art form that we are proud to support, helping to preserve this beautiful, time-honoured craft for generations to come. Where engraving is available, the options and maximum number of characters will be listed on the relevant product page.</p>
	                <p>If you are considering a more detailed or customised engraving – such as a family crest, illustration or motif on a signet face – please contact our Customer Service team with your design details. We will be happy to discuss what may be possible and provide a personalised quotation based on the complexity and feasibility of your chosen design.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What happens if I order the wrong ring size?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Please contact our Customer Service team as soon as possible so we can review the available options with you.</p>
	                <p>If you need to change a size before production begins, please get in touch within 24 hours of placing your order. We will always make reasonable efforts to accommodate your request, although changes cannot be guaranteed once work on your piece has commenced.</p>
	                <p>Depending on the change required, additional costs or an adjustment to the production timeframe may apply. We will always discuss this with you before proceeding.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Can all NMJ rings be resized?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Not every ring can be resized, as suitability depends on the individual design, construction, materials, stone setting and the extent of the adjustment required.</p>
	                <p>Every resizing request is carefully assessed by our Production team to ensure the integrity of your piece is protected. Some designs may have limited resizing capacity or may not be suitable for resizing at all.</p>
	                <p>Where applicable, resize eligibility will be noted on the individual product page. Our Customer Service team is also available to guide you before ordering.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Accordion__Section Heading Heading--caps Heading--textFont u-h6">
		<span class="Anchor" id="block-static-3"></span>
		<p>Orders and Production</p>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What is the difference between Made to Order and Ready to Wear?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Most of our jewellery is Made to Order, meaning it is handcrafted especially for you once your order has been confirmed. The estimated production timeframe for each piece is displayed on its individual product page.</p>
	                <p>Ready to Wear pieces have already been crafted and are generally available for dispatch within two business days of order confirmation. If resizing, personalisation or another customisation is required, a longer timeframe may apply.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How long will my order take to make?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>As many of our pieces are handcrafted to order, production timeframes vary depending on the design and the process involved in bringing it to life.</p>
	                <p>The estimated production timeframe is displayed on the individual product page and begins on the first business day after your order is confirmed. Please keep in mind that this timeframe does not include shipping or delivery.</p>
	                <p>While we take great care to meet our estimated timeframes, occasional delays may occur due to material availability, production requirements or other unforeseen circumstances. If a significant delay affects your order, we will contact you as soon as possible.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Can you accommodate an urgent order or a particular date?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>If you require your piece by a particular date, please contact our Customer Service team before placing your order.</p>
	                <p>We will always do our best to accommodate meaningful dates wherever possible and can advise whether your requested timeframe is achievable. However, delivery by a particular date cannot be guaranteed unless it has been expressly confirmed by our team.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Can I change or cancel my order after it has been placed?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>If you would like to make a change to your order, please contact our Customer Service Team as soon as possible.</p>
	                <p>Requests to change a size or add or update personalisation should be made within 24 hours of placing your order. As many of our pieces are made especially for you, changes may not be possible once production has commenced.</p>
	                <p>We will always do our best to accommodate your request where possible and will let you know if any additional costs or changes to the production timeframe apply before proceeding.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Can I change my personal or delivery details after ordering?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>If your order has not yet been dispatched, we may be able to update your contact details or delivery address.</p>
	                <p>Please contact our Customer Service team as soon as you notice an error. We will do our best to help, although changes cannot always be accommodated once an order has been processed or prepared for dispatch.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How can I check the status of my order?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>An estimated production timeframe is provided on each product page as a guide. As many of our pieces are handcrafted to order, these timeframes may vary slightly depending on the intricacy of the design and the individual production process.</p>
	                <p>Our Customer Care team will be in touch if we anticipate any delays to your order. If you would like an update at any stage, please contact us with your order details and our team will be happy to check its progress for you.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How will my order be packaged and presented?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Your piece will arrive beautifully presented in our signature NMJ jewellery box. Orders being delivered will be carefully protected inside a cardboard shipping box, cushioned with shredded PEFC-certified shredded paper and enclosed in a compostable mailer.</p>
	                <p>Our beaded Sashi and Sana necklaces will arrive in our custom embroidered NMJ linen pouch. While our tennis &amp; Ember bracelets and necklaces will arrive in our exclusive NMJ timber boxes.</p>
	                <p>If you select gift wrapping at checkout, your piece will be finished in our signature NMJ wrapping and tied with a ribbon made from 100% Australian grown cotton, ready to gift to someone special.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Can I include a gift message?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
