	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>An estimated timeframe will be provided alongside your repair or service quotation. This timeframe is a guide only, as the full extent of the work required may not become apparent until our jewellers begin working on your piece.</p>
	                <p>If we find that additional time or further work is needed, our Customer Service team will be in touch to discuss this with you and provide an updated timeframe.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How should I care for and store my jewellery?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>To keep your jewellery looking its best, we recommend removing it before washing your hands, showering, swimming, exercising or sleeping. Soap, natural skin oils and other residue can collect beneath settings and between fine chain links, attracting dirt and causing your piece to become dull more quickly.</p>
	                <p>Jewellery should also be removed before applying creams, lotions, perfumes and other beauty products, as these can leave a sticky residue on the metal and stones.</p>
	                <p>When not being worn, store each piece separately in a clean, dry place or soft jewellery pouch to help protect it from moisture, tarnishing, scratching or tangling. Our signature NMJ boxes are designed for presentation rather than long-term storage, as the adhesives used within jewellery boxes may react with precious metals over time and contribute to tarnishing.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How often should I clean my jewellery at home?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>For pieces worn regularly, we recommend a gentle at-home clean every few weeks, or whenever you notice a build-up of oils, lotions or everyday residue. Lightly wiping your jewellery with a soft, lint-free cloth after wear can also help maintain its finish between cleans.</p>
	                <p>The most suitable cleaning method will depend on the metal, stones and construction of your piece, as some gemstones require more delicate care. Always refer to our Care Guide for instructions on cleaning your particular piece, and if you are unsure, contact our Customer Service team before cleaning it at home.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How often should my jewellery be professionally serviced?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>We recommend having stone-set jewellery professionally inspected and serviced every 12 months. Regular servicing allows our jewellers to check the settings, claws and overall condition of your piece, helping to identify signs of wear before they develop into more significant issues.</p>
	                <p>We offer a complimentary annual clean and service for all NMJ bespoke and online engagement pieces. Please contact our Customer Service team or visit one of our showrooms to arrange your service.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Which stones require additional care or should not be cleaned at home?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Delicate, porous or heavily included stones require additional care. This includes our Sashi and Sana pieces, pearls, opals, emerald, turquoise, lapis lazuli, coral and amber. These stones can be sensitive to moisture, heat, chemicals, sudden temperature changes and vigorous cleaning.</p>
	                <p>Avoid placing these pieces in ultrasonic or steam cleaners, soaking them in water or using household cleaners, detergents and abrasive cloths. Instead, gently wipe them with a clean, soft, slightly damp cloth and allow them to dry completely before storing.</p>
	                <p>If you are unsure how to care for a particular stone or product, please contact our Customer Care team before cleaning it at home. We will be happy to advise on the safest method of your piece.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Why has my jewellery tarnished, and how can I help prevent it?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Tarnishing is a natural surface reaction that can occur when precious metals are exposed to air, moisture, natural skin oils, chemicals and environmental elements. It is particularly common with sterling silver but may also appear on gold alloys over time. Tarnishing does not mean your jewellery is faulty and can generally be removed through appropriate cleaning or professional servicing.</p>
	                <p>To help minimise tarnishing, remove your jewellery before showering, swimming, exercising or applying perfumes, lotions and cleaning products. After wearing, gently wipe each piece with a soft, lint-free cloth and store it separately in a clean, dry jewellery pouch.</p>
	                <p>Our signature NMJ boxes are intended for presentation rather than long-term storage, as adhesives used within jewellery boxes may react with precious metals over time and contribute to tarnishing.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Do you recommend insuring my jewellery?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Yes, we strongly recommend arranging comprehensive insurance for your jewellery, particularly engagement rings, bespoke pieces and other precious or frequently worn designs. While our warranty covers eligible manufacturing faults, it does not cover loss, theft or accidental damage.</p>
	                <p>We recommend confirming the level of protection offered, including whether your policy provides cover while travelling when your jewellery is worn outside the home.</p>
	                <p>Our team can support with setting up an interim policy for you upon collection of your piece.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Accordion__Section Heading Heading--caps Heading--textFont u-h6">
		<span class="Anchor" id="block-static-9"></span>
		<p>Archive Sale</p>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Are Archive Sale purchases final sale?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Yes. Archive Sale purchases are final sale and cannot be returned, exchanged, refunded or credited for change of mind, incorrect sizing or minor imperfections that were disclosed.</p>
	                <p>As these pieces are offered in limited quantities and often include discontinued, sample or display designs, we encourage you to carefully review the product description, imagery, condition and sizing before purchasing.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>When will my Archive Sale order be dispatched?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Please allow up to five business days for your Archive Sale order to be carefully prepared and dispatched.</p>
	                <p>Once your order has been shipped, we will send you a confirmation email containing your tracking information.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Do Archive Sale pieces come with a manufacturing warranty?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Yes. Archive Sale pieces remain covered by the applicable manufacturer’s warranty in relation to eligible manufacturing or craftsmanship faults.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Accordion__Section Heading Heading--caps Heading--textFont u-h6">
		<span class="Anchor" id="block-static-10"></span>
		<p>Engagement Rings</p>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What engagement ring styles do you offer?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Our online engagement collection includes a thoughtfully curated range of designs, from refined solitaires and timeless trilogies to more intricate, vintage inspired settings.</p>
	                <p>Many of our designs can be created with your choice of precious metal, stone type, shape and size, allowing you to find a ring that feels uniquely yours. If you are looking for something truly individual, our bespoke engagement ring service will pair you with one of our dedicated designers, who will work closely with you to create a ring that thoughtfully reflects your vision.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What is the difference between an online and a bespoke engagement ring?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Our online engagement rings are thoughtfully designed NMJ pieces that can be purchased through our website or in one of our showrooms. Once your order has been placed, our dedicated Production team will carefully select the best available stone for your ring in accordance with our stringent quality specifications. Your piece will then be individually crafted for you, bringing your chosen design to life with care and consideration.</p>
	                <p>Our bespoke service offers a more personalised design experience. You will be paired with a dedicated bespoke designer who will guide you through each stage of the process, from exploring your ideas and sourcing stones for you to view, through to refining the final design. You will also receive drawings and sketches to review and approve before your ring enters production.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Can I customise an NMJ engagement ring?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Our laboratory-grown diamond engagement rings are available in a considered selection of stone sizes. For designs featuring larger stones, we have thoughtfully increased the band dimensions to ensure the setting remains beautifully balanced while supporting the strength and integrity of your ring.</p>
	                <p>You can personalise your piece with custom hand engraving or a hidden stone, creating a meaningful detail that is uniquely yours.</p>
	                <p>If you are considering further customisations, please contact our Customer Service team. They will guide you through the available options or, where appropriate, pair you with a dedicated bespoke designer to begin your bespoke journey.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How do I choose the right metal, diamond or gemstone?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Choosing the right materials for your ring is a deeply personal decision, guided by your individual style, lifestyle, values and budget.</p>
	                <p>When selecting a precious metal, consider the colour you are naturally drawn to, the jewellery you already wear and how your ring will suit everyday life. Your choice of diamond or gemstone may be influenced by its shape, colour, rarity, origin and the story or meaning it holds for you.</p>
	                <p>Our team can guide you through the differences between yellow, rose and white gold and platinum, as well as natural diamonds, laboratory-grown diamonds and coloured gemstones. Visit one of our showrooms or book an engagement or bespoke appointment to explore the options and find the combination that feels most like you.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How do you source stones for your engagement rings?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Our dedicated in-house Diamond and Gemstone Specialist sources a stone for each engagement ring as it is ordered. Working within our stringent quality specifications, they carefully consider the available options and select the stone that best complements your chosen design, size and setting.</p>
	                <p>This considered approach allows us to select the best available stone for your individual piece, ensuring every engagement ring is brought to life with exceptional care and attention to detail.</p>
	                <p>Through our bespoke services, clients can choose to explore the extensive options of stones available, from coloured stones to mined or laboratory grown diamonds.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How long will my engagement ring take to make?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>As each engagement ring is individually crafted for you, production timeframes will vary depending on the design and level of customisation. The estimated production timeframe for our online engagement rings is provided on each product page as a guide.</p>
	                <p>For bespoke engagement rings, your designer will provide an estimated timeframe as part of the design process, once the details of your piece have been confirmed.</p>
	                <p>If you are working toward a particular date, please let our team know as early as possible. While we cannot always accommodate shorter timeframes, we will be happy to discuss the available options with you. If we anticipate any delays once your order is in production, our Customer Care team will keep you informed.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Can you accommodate a particular proposal date?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>If you are planning to propose on a particular date, please let us know as early as possible and before placing your order. Our Customer Care team will review the production requirements of your chosen ring and advise whether your preferred timeframe can be accommodated.</p>
	                <p>While we will always do our best to work toward meaningful dates, shorter production timeframes cannot always be guaranteed. If a made-to-order or bespoke ring cannot be completed in time, our team may be able to guide you toward another suitable option.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How can I ensure my engagement ring will sit with a wedding band?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>The profile and setting of your engagement ring will determine how it sits alongside a wedding band. Some designs allow a straight band to sit flush, while others may pair more beautifully with a curved or contoured band.</p>
	                <p>If you plan to wear the two rings together, we recommend considering your wedding band during the engagement ring selection process. Our team can guide you through compatible pairings and help you find pieces that feel balanced and comfortable when worn together.</p>
	                <p>You are welcome to visit one of our showrooms with your engagement ring or book a ceremonial appointment to explore the options in person. If an existing band is not quite right, we can also discuss creating a bespoke wedding band designed to complement your engagement ring.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Can my engagement ring be resized if it does not fit?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Eligible Engagement, Bespoke and Ceremonial rings receive one complimentary resize when requested within six months of the original purchase date.</p>
	                <p>Every resize is carefully assessed to ensure it can be completed without compromising the integrity of the design. Eligibility depends on the piece and will be noted on the individual product page.</p>
	                <p>Any additional resizing, or resizing requested outside the complimentary period, will be assessed and quoted separately.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What warranty, servicing and care come with my engagement ring?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Our Engagement and Bespoke pieces are created to be worn and treasured for a lifetime.</p>
	                <p>They are covered by a limited lifetime manufacturer’s warranty for eligible manufacturing and craftmanship faults, subject to our Terms. Eligible Engagement and Bespoke pieces also receive complimentary lifetime routine servicing.</p>
	                <p>To help preserve the beauty and integrity of your piece, we recommend returning it to NMJ every 12 months for inspection and servicing.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Do you work with heirloom or customer-supplied stones?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>We may work with client-supplied heirloom stones through our Heirloom Service.</p>
	                <p>Every supplied stone and piece must first be carefully assessed by our team. Heirloom and previously worn materials can carry existing wear or structural vulnerabilities, and not every stone will be suitable for resetting or for the proposed design.</p>
	                <p>Where we consider a stone to be unsuitable, we may decline to use it in order to protect both the material and the integrity of the finished piece.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Accordion__Section Heading Heading--caps Heading--textFont u-h6">
		<span class="Anchor" id="block-static-11"></span>
		<strong>Bespoke Jewellery</strong>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What is your bespoke service, and how does the process work?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Our bespoke service is a deeply personal design experience, allowing you to create a piece that is thoughtfully tailored to your story, style and vision.</p>
	                <p>You will be paired with a dedicated bespoke designer, beginning with an initial discovery call to explore your ideas, preferences, budget and timeframe. From there, your designer will source suitable stones and share initial design concepts and quotations for your consideration.</p>
	                <p>Where relevant, you will be invited to a private stone viewing with your designer before receiving detailed sketches or renders of your piece to review and approve. Once the final design has been confirmed and your deposit has been paid, your piece will move into production, where it will be carefully brought to life by our skilled team.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How long does the bespoke process take?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>The timeframe for your bespoke journey will vary depending on the complexity of your design, the number of stones you would like to consider and the time required to source the perfect option.</p>
	                <p>Particularly rare or specialised stones may take longer to locate, while additional rounds of design refinements may also extend the process. Your bespoke designer will keep you informed throughout each stage and provide an estimated timeframe based on the unique requirements of your piece.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How much does a bespoke piece cost, and is there a minimum spend?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>There is no minimum spend for our bespoke service. Each piece is individually quoted based on its unique design, including the precious metal, stone selection, complexity and craftsmanship involved.</p>
	                <p>Following your initial discovery call or appointment, your designer will share initial concepts and quotations for your consideration. Any design decisions or refinements that may affect the price will be discussed with you throughout the process before the final design is approved.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What deposit is required, and can I pay in instalments?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Payment for your bespoke piece is made in two stages. A 50-75% deposit is required before production begins, allowing us to secure your selected materials and commence crafting your piece. The remaining balance is due once your piece is complete and before it is dispatched or collected.</p>
	                <p>Your bespoke designer will keep you informed throughout the process and provide payment instructions at each stage.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How do you source stones for bespoke pieces?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>We work with a trusted network of carefully selected stone suppliers who meet our due diligence requirements for responsible sourcing and business practices.</p>
	                <p>During your initial discovery call or appointment, your bespoke designer will take the time to understand your preferences, including stone type, shape, colour, size, quality and budget. They will then thoughtfully source a selection of stones that best reflect your vision for you to consider.</p>
	                <p>The sourcing timeframe will vary depending on your requirements, as particularly rare or specialised stones may take longer to find.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Will I approve the design before production begins?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Yes. Before your piece enters production, your bespoke designer will provide sketches, digital renders or reference imagery for you to review.</p>
	                <p>You will have the opportunity to discuss the design, request any final refinements and confirm that you are happy with each detail. Production will only begin once you have approved the final design and paid your deposit.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Do you create bespoke pieces other than engagement rings?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Yes, our bespoke service extends beyond engagement rings to a variety of meaningful, one-of-a-kind pieces.</p>
	                <p>We recommend exploring our bespoke archive to discover examples of previous commissions and gain a sense of what may be possible. If you have a particular idea in mind, please contact our Customer Care team, who can discuss your vision and guide you through the next steps.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Do you work with customer-supplied or heirloom stones?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Yes, we may be able to incorporate customer-supplied or heirloom stones into a bespoke piece on a case-by-case basis.</p>
	                <p>Before confirming whether we can work with your stone, our team will need to assess its condition, dimensions and suitability for the proposed design. As older stones may have existing wear, damage or unique setting requirements, not every stone will be suitable for resetting.</p>
	                <p>Please contact our Customer Care team with details and imagery of your stone, and they will guide you through the assessment process and available options</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What options are available if I do not have time to complete the bespoke process?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>If your proposal date is approaching and there is not enough time to complete the full bespoke process, we may be able to arrange a temporary proposal ring, such as our Promise Ring.</p>
	                <p>This allows you to propose with a beautiful piece while giving you and your partner the opportunity to begin the bespoke journey together afterward. You can then collaborate with one of our dedicated bespoke designers to create an engagement ring that thoughtfully reflects your shared vision.</p>
	                <p>We also stock a selection of ‘ready to wear’ engagement styles in our boutiques and online which can be purchased for immediate dispatch.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>How long is a bespoke quote valid?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Bespoke quotations are valid for 14 days from the date of issue. As precious metal and gemstone prices fluctuate, any quotation accepted after this period may need to be reviewed and updated.</p>
	                <p>Please note that quoted stones are subject to availability and are not secured until your deposit has been received. If your preferred stone is no longer available, your bespoke designer will source a comparable alternative for your consideration and provide an updated quotation where required.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>What warranty, resizing and servicing are included with a bespoke piece?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Our bespoke pieces are accompanied by a limited lifetime manufacturing warranty, subject to the piece being returned to NMJ for its complimentary annual clean, inspection and service. This allows our jewellers to assess the settings, claws and overall condition of your piece and identify signs of wear before they develop into more significant concerns.</p>
	                <p>Bespoke engagement and ceremonial rings also include one complimentary resize within six months of receiving your piece, where the design allows. Some styles, stone settings and significant size adjustments may not be suitable for resizing, and our team will assess this on a case-by-case basis.</p>
	                <p>Our warranty covers eligible manufacturing faults but does not extend to accidental damage, loss, theft, general wear and tear or work completed by another jeweller. We recommend arranging comprehensive insurance to protect your piece once it has been received.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Where should I have my bespoke piece cleaned and serviced?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Your bespoke piece should be returned to Natalie Marie Jewellery for its complimentary annual clean, inspection and service. This allows our jewellers to carefully assess the settings, claws and overall condition of your piece, while ensuring any servicing is completed in accordance with its original design and craftsmanship.</p>
	                <p>Annual servicing by NMJ is required to maintain the validity of your limited lifetime manufacturing warranty. Please contact our Customer Care team or bring your piece into either of our showrooms to arrange your service. We recommend that repairs, resizing or alterations are not undertaken by another jeweller, as third-party work may affect your warranty.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

	<div class="Collapsible">
	  <button class="Collapsible__Button Heading u-h4" data-action="toggle-collapsible" aria-expanded="false">
	    <p>Do you work with interstate and international clients?</p> <span class="Collapsible__Plus"></span>
	  </button>
	  <div class="Collapsible__Inner">
	    <div class="Collapsible__Content Collapsible__Content--removeInset">
	      <div class="Rte">
	                <p>Yes, we work with clients across Australia and around the world. Your bespoke journey can be facilitated remotely through video appointments, phone calls and email, allowing you to collaborate closely with your designer at each stage of the process.</p>
	                <p>Once complete, your bespoke piece can be securely shipped interstate or internationally. International clients should refer to our Shipping and Duties &amp; Taxes Terms and Conditions for information regarding delivery, customs requirements and any applicable import duties or taxes.</p>
	      </div>
	    </div>
	  </div>
	</div>

			</div>
			<div class="Grid__Cell 3/16--lap-and-up"></div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

